Subject: [PATCH 1090/3799] soh: rename func_80AFB768 -> EnSi_Idle

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the token's resting action: eases the scale to 0.25, spins it, and on an OC hit awards ITEM_SKULL_TOKEN and starts the collect sequence; a hookshot attachment diverts it to the pulled state.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Si/z_en_si.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
